meta {
  name: Delete All Backlog Entries
  type: http
  seq: 22
}

delete {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/backlog/entries
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  ~space_id: {{spaceId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  Permanently deletes every backlog entry of the caller (category
  associations cascade with them) and returns the number of entries
  removed. Destructive - there is no undo. Only affects the caller's
  own entries; other users' backlogs are untouched, and a shared
  space's entries are never touched without space_id.

  Enable space_id (run space/Get Space first) to delete every entry of
  the shared space instead - for both members, not just your own. 404
  when the caller is not an active member of that space. Run auth/Login
  first.
}